---
/**
 * Homepage 1 — "The Method" section (xnrgy "Meet the Gym" reference).
 *
 * Light/paper band: a small mono kicker, an oversized black display headline
 * spanning wide, then a two-column row — a mono body paragraph on the left, a
 * large image on the right.
 *
 * Sits after "Three Arenas": where that section names the three arenas, this
 * one names the throughline between them — the discipline that makes them one
 * practice, and what it means for the people who work with Ibrahim.
 */
---

<section class="section-pad bg-paper pb-40 text-ink lg:pb-56">
  <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[110rem] px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <!-- Small mono kicker -->
    <p
      class="font-mono text-sm font-bold tracking-[0.2em] text-ink/70 uppercase"
      data-reveal
    >
      Where Discipline Becomes Advantage
    </p>

    <!-- Oversized black display headline (wide) -->
    <h2
      class="mt-4 max-w-[18ch] font-display text-[clamp(2.5rem,7vw,6.5rem)] leading-[0.98] font-normal tracking-[-0.02em] uppercase"
      data-reveal
    >
      The Method Behind the Fight
    </h2>

    <!-- Two-column row: mono body (left), large image (right) -->
    <div class="mt-14 grid gap-12 lg:mt-24 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:items-center lg:gap-16">
      <div class="max-w-lg space-y-6 font-mono text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink" data-reveal>
        <p>
          The courtroom, the mat, and the stage are not three separate skills —
          they are one discipline worn three ways. Preparation that borders on
          obsession. Composure that holds when the pressure is highest. The
          refusal to take the easy settlement when the fight is the right thing
          to do.
        </p>
        <p>
          That is the method, and it is what a client is really hiring: not just
          a lawyer, but the same relentless, prepared, unshakeable person who
          earned a black belt one repetition at a time. The training never
          stops. It just changes rooms.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="lg:justify-self-end" data-reveal>
        <img
          src="/temp1.png"
          alt="[PLACEHOLDER] Ibrahim Awad — the method in practice"
          class="h-auto w-full object-cover"
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
